# Optional TURN relay for online play across different networks
# (for example a phone on mobile data and a laptop on Wi-Fi).
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and add the same variables in your
# hosting provider's environment settings (Vercel: Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables), then redeploy. See src/net/iceServers.ts.

# Option A: a credentials URL (Metered's free TURN plan provides one).
# VITE_ICE_SERVERS_URL=https://<your-app>.metered.live/api/v1/turn/credentials?apiKey=<your-key>

# Option B: static TURN credentials.
# VITE_TURN_URLS=turn:relay.example.com:80,turn:relay.example.com:443?transport=tcp,turns:relay.example.com:443
# VITE_TURN_USERNAME=
# VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
